@startuml
' Facade Pattern adapted to the current backend implementation.
' Suggested LaTeX placement: normal page.

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

class "separation.py Router" as SeparationRouter <<Client>> {
  +separate_audio(audio_id, model_id)
}

class "SeparationService" as SeparationService <<Facade>> {
  +separate_uploaded_audio(db, audio_id, model_id)
  +create_running_job(db, uploaded_audio_id, model_id)
  +mark_job_failed(db, job, error, processing_time_ms)
}

class ModelService <<Subsystem>> {
  +get_model_for_separation(db, model_id)
}

class SeparationAlgorithmFactory <<Subsystem>> {
  +create(model)
}

interface SeparationAlgorithm <<Subsystem>> {
  +separate(...)
}

class "SQLite Database" as SQLite <<Subsystem>>
class "Local File Storage" as FileStorage <<Subsystem>>

SeparationRouter --> SeparationService : one workflow call
SeparationService --> ModelService : select model
SeparationService --> SeparationAlgorithmFactory : create algorithm
SeparationService --> SeparationAlgorithm : run separation
SeparationService --> SQLite : jobs/results metadata
SeparationService --> FileStorage : uploaded/output WAV files

SeparationAlgorithmFactory ..> SeparationAlgorithm : returns

note bottom
  Mapping:
  Client = separation.py Router
  Facade = SeparationService
  Subsystems = ModelService, SeparationAlgorithmFactory,
  SeparationAlgorithm, SQLite Database, Local File Storage
end note

@enduml
